esolver:`Inspect supplied typed candidates, select one and explicitly request confirmation without persisting a resolution.`,ValidationSummary:`Inspect consumer-reported validation status and complete supplied issues without running validation or inferring validity.`,RecordInspector:`Select a current supplied record field and inspect its complete typed value and evidence.`,FieldConfidenceList:`Inspect complete supplied field values and evidence with reported confidence, including zero and absence.`,ApprovalChecklist:`Review required checklist items before emitting an explicit approval intent.`,BeforeSubmitConfirmation:`Review current field values and explicitly consent before submission intent.`,DestructiveActionGuard:`Review exact impact, type the confirmation phrase and explicitly consent to destructive intent.`,HumanOverridePanel:`Select an alternative and explain an explicitly consented human override.`,PermissionRequestCard:`Review requested scopes and explicitly request or deny consumer-owned permission intent.`,ConfirmationPanel:`Review current change terms and explicitly confirm or cancel.`,RiskReviewPanel:`Acknowledge identified risks and confirm the current mitigation terms.`,ToolCallCard:`Inspect exact tool arguments, outputs and execution status.`,ToolResultCard:`Inspect an explicit tool outcome and its complete structured result without executing a tool.`,RunningTaskCard:`Review consumer-reported task progress and explicitly request inspection or cancellation.`,PartialResultViewer:`Select reported result parts, inspect complete structured values and request an eligible part retry.`,QueuedStepList:`Review ordered step states and attempts, select a step and request an eligible retry.`,ToolTraceViewer:`Filter an ordered trace and inspect complete selected event details without starting a trace runtime.`,RetryableErrorState:`Request a retry of retained tool arguments when the consumer permits it.`,DynamicQuestionFlow:`Complete conditional questions and submit only currently visible answers.`,MissingDataRequest:`Collect only missing typed fields while keeping known context read-only and outside submission.`,MultiStepForm:`Edit typed fields across controlled steps, preserve drafts and validate before progressing or submitting.`,InlineEditForm:`Review and edit typed values, then explicitly request only changed values or removals.`,FormProgressCard:`Inspect consumer-reported form status and step progress without inferring completion.`,ValidatedFieldList:`Review reported field validation, inspect complete values and request eligible field validation.`,ExtractedFieldsReview:`Correct extracted fields against originals and evidence before submission.`,DocumentPreview:`Inspect complete supplied text, JSON or ordered raster/text pages without reading or uploading a file.`,FileReview:`Review a current file representation and extracted corrections before explicit scoped save intent.`,DiffViewer:`Inspect before/after values and select an individual change for review.`,ComparisonMatrix:`Compare criteria, select an available option and explicitly confirm it.`,ScoreBreakdown:`Inspect finite weighted totals and individual criterion evidence.`,SourceEvidencePanel:`Review supporting claims and excerpts, then select an evidence source.`,SourceList:`Select a supplied source and request inspection using current source identity only.`,EvidenceDrawer:`Inspect complete supplied text or JSON in a dismissible native modal without fetching or verifying it.`,AuthRequiredCard:`Request scoped access through a consumer-owned intent callback.`},_={ToolResultCard:{modelVisible:[`id`,`tool`,`status`],privateOnly:[`title`,`description`,`result`,`errorMessage`],callsTools:[],destructive:!1},RunningTaskCard:{modelVisible:[`id`,`status`,`progress`,`elapsedMs`],privateOnly:[`title`,`description`,`currentStep`,`errorMessage`],callsTools:[],destructive:!1},PartialResultViewer:{modelVisible:[`id`,`status`,`parts.id`,`parts.status`,`parts.attempt`,`selectedPart